---
# Runner self-test: spec/support/assets/ is copied to assets/ in every sandbox's cwd.
testability: api
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  image "assets/red-40x30.png"
end
----------- test code
assert_equal "assets/red-40x30.png", image.url
assert File.file?(image.url), "the sandbox has its own copy of the asset"
refute_includes Dir.pwd, "/spec/", "cases never run inside the repo"
